stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: 写点入队 (send / rework wake / approval)
    pending --> started: lane 先记尝试 (attempts+1), 再交控制边界投递
    started --> started: not_sent 退避 2s/8s/30s 后重投正文
    started --> started: accepted 无回执 60s 后只补激活, 不重投
    started --> finished: 通知流看到 [fw-msg id] 的 userMessage
    started --> exhausted: attempts ≥ 3 → 隔离该行, 后面的行照常
    exhausted --> [*]: runner_wake_exhausted 告警 + 审计门铃
    finished --> [*]
